WEBVTT

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.751
Baby, carry on

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:13.756
When the winds of tomorrow howl

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:19.762
Keep on laughing, be the cocky
person that you are

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.949
No matter what happens

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:34.366
Storming through life, during
the day you feel invincible

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:42.006
Of course, there are those nights
when everything falls apart

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:48.938
You find yourself humming
an old melody

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:56.132
Through the pain you feel as sweat
stings your wounded knee

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.167
Baby, carry on

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:02.594
Even on those mornings when
the wind blows in your face

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:09.311
Keep on laughing, and even the moon
shall one day look upon you

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.313
Someday your journey will come

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:16.519
| can at least make one miracle happen

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.255
Until that day

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:25.241
Don't you surrender! Angel Blue!

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:45.347
This fog is terrible.

00:01:45.371 --> 00:01:47.483
Does anybody know where we are?

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:51.444
Ms. Celcia, can you help us find
elves in this mess?

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:56.180
They're around here somewhere,
so keep your eyes peeled.

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:58.961
That thing is useless.

00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:00.453
Shut your mouth!

00:02:03.056 --> 00:02:03.833
Rain.

00:02:03.857 --> 00:02:04.533
Jeez, come on, from bad to worse.
Rain.

00:02:04.557 --> 00:02:06.769
Jeez, come on, from bad to worse.

00:02:06.793 --> 00:02:10.473
Celcia, find us some shelter
from the rain.

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:12.041
How do you expect me to do that?

00:02:12.065 --> 00:02:13.542
In a spooky episode like this,

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.534
there should be a deserted mansion
around here somewhere.

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.675
There it is!

00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.722
This is some rainstorm.

00:02:41.895 --> 00:02:44.039
Oh, man! Stop it!

00:02:44.063 --> 00:02:45.574
Knock it off!

00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:48.444
| hate having water in my fur!

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:51.597
Boy, this place sure is spooky.

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:54.197
You should be grateful that we'll
have a roof over our heads!

00:02:56.342 --> 00:02:58.106
Anyone home?

00:03:00.446 --> 00:03:02.073
Anyone at all?

00:03:05.652 --> 00:03:07.029
Hello?

00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:07.129
This place smells so moldy.
Hello?

00:03:07.153 --> 00:03:08.746
This place smells so moldy.

00:03:27.607 --> 00:03:29.905
What's going on here?

00:03:35.348 --> 00:03:36.559
What now?

00:03:36.583 --> 00:03:36.825
What's wrong, Ritsuko?
What now?

00:03:36.849 --> 00:03:38.078
What's wrong, Ritsuko?

00:03:42.488 --> 00:03:44.033
It's just a painting.

00:03:44.057 --> 00:03:45.525
The house seems to be vacant.

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:49.055
Apparently, it's been that way
for a very long time.

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:51.874
Ritsuko, did you see something?

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:54.543
No, the darkness scared me.

00:03:54.567 --> 00:03:57.093
Let's look for some lights.

00:04:01.708 --> 00:04:03.198
| found some candles.

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:07.380
A flower?

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:09.658
Ms. Celcia, what's the matter?

00:04:09.682 --> 00:04:10.492
Look at that flower.

00:04:10.516 --> 00:04:11.160
What flower?
Look at that flower.

00:04:11.184 --> 00:04:11.980
What flower?

00:04:14.254 --> 00:04:16.518
There was a fresh red
flower in that pot!

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:20.135
Whatever. It looks like we'll be
staying here for the night.

00:04:20.159 --> 00:04:21.003
Okay.

00:04:21.027 --> 00:04:21.637
No!
Okay.

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:21.837
No!

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:22.504
No! In this weather, we
can't afford to be picky.

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:24.740
In this weather, we can't
afford to be picky.

00:04:24.764 --> 00:04:27.276
But this place is haunted.

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:30.412
You're acting like a little girl.

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:32.181
What's wrong with that?

00:04:32.205 --> 00:04:34.350
There's no such thing as ghosts.

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:36.452
The weirdest thing in this house
is our killer dog-girl.

00:04:36.476 --> 00:04:38.240
Watch your mouth!

00:04:58.398 --> 00:04:59.875
Ghosts?

00:04:59.899 --> 00:05:01.543
Don't be silly.

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:03.729
There's no such thing as ghosts!

00:05:18.217 --> 00:05:20.185
Ms. Celcial

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.398
What is it?

00:05:22.422 --> 00:05:22.598
Footsteps!
What is it?

00:05:22.622 --> 00:05:23.999
Footsteps!

00:05:24.023 --> 00:05:25.668
What footsteps?

00:05:25.692 --> 00:05:28.237
What? But I just heard them!

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:31.006
You imagined it. Go to sleep.

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:32.908
Did I imagine it?

00:05:32.932 --> 00:05:34.576
| must havel!

00:05:34.600 --> 00:05:36.295
My imagination! My imagination!

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:51.040
Ms. Celcial

00:05:51.617 --> 00:05:52.961
What is it now?

00:05:52.985 --> 00:05:53.095
| heard a strange voice!
What is it now?

00:05:53.119 --> 00:05:54.997
| heard a strange voice!

00:05:55.021 --> 00:05:56.732
A strange voice?

00:05:56.756 --> 00:05:59.068
What? But I did hear a strange voice!

00:05:59.092 --> 00:06:02.638
Your imagination again.
It was just the wind.

00:06:02.662 --> 00:06:04.239
Goodnight.

00:06:04.263 --> 00:06:06.709
No! No! Don't fall asleep on me!

00:06:06.733 --> 00:06:09.411
Ritsuko, please.

00:06:09.435 --> 00:06:11.914
Staying up late is bad for my coat.

00:06:11.938 --> 00:06:14.783
Ms. Celcia, would you do me a favor?

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:16.275
What is it?

00:06:17.176 --> 00:06:18.871
Go to the bathroom.

00:06:19.645 --> 00:06:22.080
| don't want to go by myself!

00:06:28.254 --> 00:06:30.466
I'm sorry about this, Ms. Celcia.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.958
Think nothing of it.

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:40.429
Take that, you lousy ghost!

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:43.564
Ritsuko! Ritsuko! Stop shooting!

00:06:45.071 --> 00:06:47.870
It was just the curtain being
blown around by the wind!

00:06:49.709 --> 00:06:51.973
You're a lot scarier than any ghost.

00:06:52.545 --> 00:06:53.689
I'm so sorry.

00:06:53.713 --> 00:06:54.022
Ritsuko, you're letting your fear
take control of you. I'm so sorry.

00:06:54.046 --> 00:06:56.913
Ritsuko, you're letting your
fear take control of you.

00:06:57.316 --> 00:06:59.808
But I swear that I heard that voice!

00:07:01.287 --> 00:07:03.585
Yeah, it sounded just like that.

00:07:26.746 --> 00:07:28.214
Junpei!

00:07:29.382 --> 00:07:32.394
Ms. Airi, is it time to eat?!

00:07:32.418 --> 00:07:34.750
| thought I heard Ritsuko and
Ms. Celcia screaming.

00:07:35.922 --> 00:07:39.790
They probably caught a glimpse
of themselves in a mirror.

00:07:45.998 --> 00:07:47.443
Jun... Junpei?

00:07:47.467 --> 00:07:48.977
Wha... what the hell is that?

00:07:49.001 --> 00:07:50.479
Help!

00:07:50.503 --> 00:07:51.947
G...g... g...

00:07:51.971 --> 00:07:53.615
G...g...g... ho... ho... ho...

00:07:53.639 --> 00:07:55.117
<i>G...g...g... ho...ho...ho... s...s...sl</i>

00:07:55.141 --> 00:07:57.269
A ghost? Like that one?

00:07:58.544 --> 00:08:00.989
<i>Another one!</i>

00:08:01.013 --> 00:08:04.092
Cut it out! Get a hold of yourselves!

00:08:04.116 --> 00:08:08.349
Some joker is making shadow figures
on the curtain. Watch.

00:08:08.921 --> 00:08:12.551
Now the scary ghost looks
like a funny, bloated pig.

00:08:14.093 --> 00:08:15.720
Now it's lost weight.

00:08:16.629 --> 00:08:18.859
Now it's trying to be an umbrella
monster. That's pretty lame.

00:08:19.799 --> 00:08:21.210
A dog.

00:08:21.234 --> 00:08:21.276
A bird.
A dog.

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:22.444
A bird.

00:08:22.468 --> 00:08:22.711
A bird.
A cat.

00:08:22.735 --> 00:08:23.312
A cat.

00:08:23.336 --> 00:08:23.946
A kettle.
A cat.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:24.680
A kettle.

00:08:24.704 --> 00:08:24.813
A kettle.
A doughnut?

00:08:24.837 --> 00:08:25.881
A doughnut?

00:08:25.905 --> 00:08:26.181
No, it's an inner tube.
A doughnut?

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:27.850
No, it's an inner tube.

00:08:27.874 --> 00:08:30.152
Is it @ horseshoe?

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:31.920
No, that's not it.

00:08:31.944 --> 00:08:33.655
It's giving us a clue.

00:08:33.679 --> 00:08:35.657
Is it a chair?

00:08:35.681 --> 00:08:37.672
| got it! A toilet seat!

00:08:40.887 --> 00:08:44.517
| trapped you! Ghosts don't
play charades!

00:08:45.558 --> 00:08:47.287
Show yourself, you fake!

00:08:50.363 --> 00:08:51.831
Get back here! You can't outrun me!

00:09:00.139 --> 00:09:01.766
Damn! Where did they run off to?

00:09:04.844 --> 00:09:06.321
Did you catch them?

00:09:06.345 --> 00:09:07.813
Damn things disappeared.

00:09:12.051 --> 00:09:13.519
It's that flower!

00:09:20.426 --> 00:09:22.070
What's going on here, Celcia?

00:09:22.094 --> 00:09:23.438
| can't believe it!

00:09:23.462 --> 00:09:26.341
| never imagined that these
flowers actually existed!

00:09:26.365 --> 00:09:27.976
What's so special about them?

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:31.380
These are enchanted flowers.
They're mandrakes.

00:09:31.404 --> 00:09:32.915
Mandrakes?

00:09:32.939 --> 00:09:37.052
| saw a drawing of them in an
ancient text long ago.

00:09:37.076 --> 00:09:38.703
It told of their legend.

00:09:39.345 --> 00:09:42.257
When an innocent man is hanged
and his tears fall to the ground,

00:09:42.281 --> 00:09:45.027
a flower will sprout in that very
spot during the night.

00:09:45.051 --> 00:09:46.849
A mandrake.

00:09:47.286 --> 00:09:48.754
When that flower is picked...

00:10:02.168 --> 00:10:05.314
...anyone who hears its scream
will die of fright!

00:10:05.338 --> 00:10:08.350
That story's not half as scary
as your face was.

00:10:08.374 --> 00:10:09.585
Really.

00:10:09.609 --> 00:10:09.851
Oh well, I guess we better find
another place to stay for tonight. Really.

00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:13.889
Oh well, I guess we better find another
place to stay for tonight.

00:10:13.913 --> 00:10:15.938
Don't start up with that again!

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:20.262
They're back!

00:10:20.286 --> 00:10:22.965
Don't be so stupid!
It's just an old legend!

00:10:22.989 --> 00:10:24.800
I'll prove it to you right now!

00:10:24.824 --> 00:10:27.316
Don't you dare! If you pick
that flower, you'll die!

00:10:27.827 --> 00:10:29.071
Is that what you think?

00:10:29.095 --> 00:10:30.973
I'll just yank this up and show
you how wrong you are!

00:10:30.997 --> 00:10:32.474
Heed my warning!

00:10:32.498 --> 00:10:34.076
It's superstitious nonsense!

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.034
Cover your ears, everybody!

00:10:42.108 --> 00:10:44.600
You want to scream?
Go ahead and scream!

00:10:57.323 --> 00:10:58.400
It's a mandrake!

00:10:58.424 --> 00:10:58.800
But look at its ears!
It's a mandrake!

00:10:58.824 --> 00:10:59.401
But look at its ears!

00:10:59.425 --> 00:10:59.901
But look at its ears!
It's an elf.

00:10:59.925 --> 00:11:00.892
It's an elf.

00:11:02.595 --> 00:11:04.996
Get your hands off of me! Pervert!

00:11:06.065 --> 00:11:07.142
Why, I ought to...

00:11:07.166 --> 00:11:07.542
Leave her alone! This isn't like
the legend at all! Why, I ought to...

00:11:07.566 --> 00:11:10.178
Leave her alone! This isn't
like the legend at all!

00:11:10.202 --> 00:11:11.761
Who are you?

00:11:12.471 --> 00:11:13.615
The legend?

00:11:13.639 --> 00:11:16.251
| don't know who created that lie, but
they obviously never met us.

00:11:16.275 --> 00:11:18.420
We are the mandrake elves!

00:11:18.444 --> 00:11:21.209
That legend contains no
truth whatsoever!

00:11:21.647 --> 00:11:25.093
This is a nest of mandrake elves.

00:11:25.117 --> 00:11:27.162
The house isn't haunted?

00:11:27.186 --> 00:11:31.133
Haunted? No, we wanted
to scare you away.

00:11:31.157 --> 00:11:35.303
| understand. You tried to use our
fear to protect your territory.

00:11:35.327 --> 00:11:37.172
Yeah, something like that.

00:11:37.196 --> 00:11:39.927
Now, if you would be so kind,
please go away.

00:11:41.967 --> 00:11:43.435
We're sorry.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:48.450
See? I told you there was no
such thing as ghosts.

00:11:48.474 --> 00:11:49.951
Yeah, yeah.

00:11:49.975 --> 00:11:53.001
You have to admit that those
elves are pretty clever.

00:11:53.612 --> 00:11:56.980
Imagine that! Elves pretending
to be ghosts!

00:11:57.583 --> 00:11:58.093
El...

00:11:58.117 --> 00:11:58.427
<i>El... ..ve...</i>

00:11:58.451 --> 00:11:59.061
<i>El... ..ve... ..s!</i>

00:11:59.085 --> 00:12:01.952
Elves! We hunt elves! Let's go!

00:12:04.223 --> 00:12:06.501
They nearly fooled us!

00:12:06.525 --> 00:12:09.738
A precious spell fragment might be
hiding somewhere in this garden!

00:12:09.762 --> 00:12:11.560
But look how many there are.

00:12:11.931 --> 00:12:15.390
Maybe we can negotiate with them.

00:12:15.868 --> 00:12:17.345
Absolutely not!

00:12:17.369 --> 00:12:19.848
These are cunning little devils who
dared to match wits with me!

00:12:19.872 --> 00:12:21.983
We will beat them first and
ask questions later!

00:12:22.007 --> 00:12:23.885
So start plucking!

00:12:23.909 --> 00:12:25.520
Yank 'em all!

00:12:25.544 --> 00:12:27.189
Dirty old man!

00:12:27.213 --> 00:12:29.257
Why won't he think before he acts?

00:12:29.281 --> 00:12:32.094
You want a piece of me?!
Come and get it!

00:12:32.118 --> 00:12:35.997
Damn! Coward! I'll get youl!
Get back here!

00:12:36.021 --> 00:12:38.319
Surrender and accept your fate,
you annoying little weeds!

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:47.509
| think they enjoy playing with you.

00:12:47.533 --> 00:12:49.797
You've got a big mouth.

00:12:51.771 --> 00:12:55.105
Come back here! Damn you!

00:12:55.641 --> 00:12:58.754
Hold still! Gotchal!

00:12:58.778 --> 00:13:01.022
You're fast! I'm faster!

00:13:01.046 --> 00:13:03.258
Wait! Don't do that!

00:13:03.282 --> 00:13:05.627
When will he give up?

00:13:05.651 --> 00:13:06.795
I'm sleepy.

00:13:06.819 --> 00:13:07.129
I think it's time to try a
different strategy. I'm sleepy.

00:13:07.153 --> 00:13:09.383
I think it's time to try a
different strategy.

00:13:13.626 --> 00:13:16.027
Okay, I'll get you now.

00:13:17.263 --> 00:13:18.731
No! No! No! No! No!

00:13:20.065 --> 00:13:21.533
Timber!

00:13:23.068 --> 00:13:25.696
They're pretty energetic for
this time of the morning.

00:13:26.205 --> 00:13:28.483
All right, then.

00:13:28.507 --> 00:13:30.685
I'm gonna play rough!

00:13:30.709 --> 00:13:32.187
Right after breakfast!

00:13:32.211 --> 00:13:33.770
Here you go! A double portion!

00:13:35.714 --> 00:13:37.359
You're supposed to eat it, not inhale it.

00:13:37.383 --> 00:13:39.761
| don't want to give them
time to rest up!

00:13:39.785 --> 00:13:41.863
When I'm done, it'll be
time for Round 2!

00:13:41.887 --> 00:13:43.064
Junpei?

00:13:43.088 --> 00:13:43.365
Oh, do you want some of this?
There's a piece of fish left. Junpei?

00:13:43.389 --> 00:13:46.568
Oh, do you want some of this?
There's a piece of fish left.

00:13:46.592 --> 00:13:49.061
No, thanks. It's about the elves.

00:13:49.461 --> 00:13:53.074
I'll take care of them!
I'm just getting warmed up!

00:13:53.098 --> 00:13:55.692
Yes, well, I think it's time
to change tactics.

00:13:56.902 --> 00:14:00.361
| don't think that we can
take them by force.

00:14:01.774 --> 00:14:02.851
<i>That's the deal!</i>

00:14:02.875 --> 00:14:03.251
What a deal!
That's the deall

00:14:03.275 --> 00:14:04.085
What a deal!

00:14:04.109 --> 00:14:04.352
What a deal!
| say it again and again and again!

00:14:04.376 --> 00:14:05.741
| say it again and again and again!

00:14:08.047 --> 00:14:11.793
There are fools who dance
and fools who watch!

00:14:11.817 --> 00:14:15.363
If they're all fools, they should dance
and be merry together!

00:14:15.387 --> 00:14:19.467
That's the deal! What a deal! I say
it again and again and again!

00:14:19.491 --> 00:14:23.338
There are fools who dance
and fools who watch!

00:14:23.362 --> 00:14:25.974
If they're all fools, they should dance...

00:14:25.998 --> 00:14:28.910
Operation Peace and Love?

00:14:28.934 --> 00:14:31.513
They fooled us. Now we fool them.

00:14:31.537 --> 00:14:34.816
There are fools who dance
and fools who watch!

00:14:34.840 --> 00:14:37.036
This will never work.

00:14:37.877 --> 00:14:39.521
Those who believe will be saved!

00:14:39.545 --> 00:14:41.411
We look like idiots.

00:14:41.847 --> 00:14:44.316
This will never work.

00:14:45.718 --> 00:14:47.846
Look! They're elves like us!

00:14:48.454 --> 00:14:50.149
And they're having a lot of fun!

00:14:50.589 --> 00:14:52.434
New friends! New friends!

00:14:52.458 --> 00:14:54.836
Well, I'll be! They fell for it.

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:57.539
The new elves are over there!

00:14:57.563 --> 00:14:59.531
We're going to have a party!

00:15:01.767 --> 00:15:03.545
They're as dumb as they look.

00:15:03.569 --> 00:15:05.180
Your plan worked!

00:15:05.204 --> 00:15:07.764
Sometimes I envy their simplicity!

00:15:08.274 --> 00:15:10.504
Spell fragments? Spell fragments?

00:15:11.043 --> 00:15:13.288
Now for the final trick, Ritsuko.

00:15:13.312 --> 00:15:15.781
We must get these elves drunk.

00:15:16.515 --> 00:15:18.677
Check out this mini skirt!
| look like a showgirl!

00:15:19.318 --> 00:15:21.082
Who wants some wine?

00:15:22.821 --> 00:15:24.833
Me! I do! Me! Me too!

00:15:24.857 --> 00:15:26.501
Now, this is a party.

00:15:26.525 --> 00:15:29.437
This wine has a charming bouquet.

00:15:29.461 --> 00:15:31.840
It's like liquid happiness
seeping into your toes.

00:15:31.864 --> 00:15:33.475
They look like they are enjoying
themselves, don't they?

00:15:33.499 --> 00:15:35.010
Aren't they going to drink it?

00:15:35.034 --> 00:15:37.779
They behave just like plants.

00:15:37.803 --> 00:15:40.415
Ritsuko, look over here!

00:15:40.439 --> 00:15:42.851
Look at me! Look at me!

00:15:42.875 --> 00:15:44.219
Junpei?

00:15:44.243 --> 00:15:44.352
