00:16:16.408 --> 00:16:17.018
Why don't you join the party?
You talking to me?

00:16:17.042 --> 00:16:18.453
Why don't you join the party?

00:16:18.477 --> 00:16:20.036
All of your friends are there.

00:16:20.546 --> 00:16:23.880
Leave me out of it! I'm staying
right where I am!

00:16:25.818 --> 00:16:27.829
Hey, everyone!

00:16:27.853 --> 00:16:30.220
What's going on over here?

00:16:32.091 --> 00:16:34.321
Hey, baby, why don't you come out
and play with me?

00:16:36.495 --> 00:16:39.040
Stop! That hurts!

00:16:39.064 --> 00:16:41.089
You're acting like a jerk, Junpei.

00:16:42.267 --> 00:16:44.235
She's just playing hard to get.

00:16:44.603 --> 00:16:47.916
She won't come out, because she
has a funny mark on her back.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:50.068
She thinks we'll laugh at her.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:52.253
A... ...funny...

00:16:52.277 --> 00:16:53.301
A... ...funny... ...mark?

00:16:54.413 --> 00:16:58.093
| was being a jerk! How about
a little peace offering?

00:16:58.117 --> 00:17:01.018
No thank you! Just leave me alone!

00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:05.419
What? It's rude to turn
down a free drink.

00:17:06.291 --> 00:17:07.535
Oh, that breath!

00:17:07.559 --> 00:17:07.769
He's not a graceful drunk.
Oh, that breath!

00:17:07.793 --> 00:17:09.437
He's not a graceful drunk.

00:17:09.461 --> 00:17:12.192
He reminds me of this creep
| once worked for.

00:17:12.965 --> 00:17:15.710
Come on, just take a little sip.

00:17:15.734 --> 00:17:17.779
| told you I don't want any!

00:17:17.803 --> 00:17:20.448
Aw, come on, just a sip.

00:17:20.472 --> 00:17:22.417
There you go! Oh, yeah! Yeah!

00:17:22.441 --> 00:17:24.052
Stop it! No!

00:17:24.076 --> 00:17:25.186
Junpei!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:25.553
Wait, Ms. Airi. Take a look.
Junpei!

00:17:25.577 --> 00:17:27.204
Wait, Ms. Airi. Take a look.

00:17:27.646 --> 00:17:29.512
Oh, just look at yourself.

00:17:30.349 --> 00:17:32.660
You're ticking me off now.

00:17:32.684 --> 00:17:34.863
What do you mean it's last call?!

00:17:34.887 --> 00:17:35.130
She's not a very graceful drunk either.

00:17:35.154 --> 00:17:37.589
| feel funny!
