00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:44.639
What was that?! You want to step
outside, you flower-headed freak!

00:17:44.663 --> 00:17:47.826
Calm down, Ms. Celcia. It's
just the booze talking.

00:17:48.734 --> 00:17:52.313
You ain't so tough. Stupid little bitch.

00:17:52.337 --> 00:17:56.017
Oh, now she's gone and done it.

00:17:56.041 --> 00:17:58.567
Everything's okay. Look.

00:18:01.113 --> 00:18:02.581
It had to happen eventually.

00:18:10.389 --> 00:18:12.100
A spell fragment!

00:18:12.124 --> 00:18:14.269
That's the second one!

00:18:14.293 --> 00:18:18.006
But, Ritsuko, how did you know you
could pull her out so easily?

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:22.160
Airi and I noticed a strange thing when
we served the wine to them.

00:18:22.601 --> 00:18:24.679
Instead of drinking it, they
soaked themselves in it.

00:18:24.703 --> 00:18:27.070
Airi said they were behaving
just like plants.

00:18:27.439 --> 00:18:32.520
They absorbed the wine
through their skin

00:18:32.544 --> 00:18:35.590
in the same way a plant drinks
up water through its roots.

00:18:35.614 --> 00:18:37.492
Our little friend couldn't help
getting drunk

00:18:37.516 --> 00:18:39.294
when Junpei poured the wine over her.

00:18:39.318 --> 00:18:41.062
Capillary respiration!

00:18:41.086 --> 00:18:43.064
The depressant quality of the alcohol

00:18:43.088 --> 00:18:45.533
made the elf drowsy and
easier to pull out.

00:18:45.557 --> 00:18:47.068
You are correct!

00:18:47.092 --> 00:18:48.890
Junpei actually taught us
something today.

00:18:57.769 --> 00:18:59.114
Goodnight.

00:18:59.138 --> 00:18:59.247
It's not just a spot this time.
Goodnight.

00:18:59.271 --> 00:19:01.797
It's not just a spot this time.

00:19:02.274 --> 00:19:04.986
They look like fancy letters.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:08.469
Oh, boy. Oh, boy. This is the moment
I've been waiting for.

00:19:12.251 --> 00:19:14.242
Hey, get a move on, would you?

00:19:16.755 --> 00:19:20.817
| shall now perform the transfer ritual
for the second fragment.

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:25.419
Come, lonely traveler, cast
yourself upon my body.

00:19:41.547 --> 00:19:44.107
Well? Did it work? How do I look?

00:19:49.555 --> 00:19:51.819
Don't just stand there. Speak up.

00:19:52.858 --> 00:19:54.569
Mirror, please?

00:19:54.593 --> 00:19:56.061
Here.

00:20:10.175 --> 00:20:12.287
Tom, I'm afraid.

00:20:12.311 --> 00:20:14.956
Have no fear, Nancy. I'm right here.

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:17.725
| know. But they say these
woods are haunted.

00:20:17.749 --> 00:20:22.063
Nancy, even the scariest ghost would
be robbed of its powers

00:20:22.087 --> 00:20:24.055
when it saw how much
we love each other.

00:20:24.656 --> 00:20:26.590
You're so sweet, Tom.

00:20:27.626 --> 00:20:29.094
What's that?

00:20:29.494 --> 00:20:33.708
Tom, I don't like the looks of this.
Let's go home now.

00:20:33.732 --> 00:20:36.258
Relax, sugar dumpling.
I'm here to protect you.

00:20:36.935 --> 00:20:39.666
It appears as if someone had a
strange kind of party here.

00:20:40.038 --> 00:20:41.216
Oh, look at that.

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:41.516
What do you see?
Oh, look at that.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:42.383
What do you see?

00:20:42.407 --> 00:20:42.717
What do you see?
What a peculiar little plant. See it?

00:20:42.741 --> 00:20:44.641
What a peculiar little plant. See it?

00:20:46.144 --> 00:20:47.589
I think it's lovely.

00:20:47.613 --> 00:20:49.524
