00:20:49.548 --> 00:20:52.093
It's pretty, but not nearly as
beautiful as you are.

00:20:52.117 --> 00:20:52.994
Oh you!

00:20:53.018 --> 00:20:53.595
Let's take it as a souvenir
of our undying love. Oh you!

00:20:53.619 --> 00:20:55.087
Let's take it as a souvenir
of our undying love.

00:21:06.164 --> 00:21:08.710
Can't you read the stupid sign?!

00:21:08.734 --> 00:21:10.361
Another victim.

00:21:10.736 --> 00:21:13.171
How long is that mustachioed
dog going to act like that?

00:21:15.674 --> 00:21:17.118
Enjoying your hang-over?

00:21:17.142 --> 00:21:20.009
Thanks for doing most of
the work this time.

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:22.948
What did I do?

00:21:23.849 --> 00:21:25.193
Too bad you can't remember.

00:21:25.217 --> 00:21:25.326
The real question is what are we going to do
about Ms. Celcia? Too bad you can't remember.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:27.682
The real question is what are we
going to do about Ms. Celcia?

00:21:53.545 --> 00:22:00.628
It's okay to take a break on a day
when you feel despondent

00:22:00.652 --> 00:22:07.251
Life is long and fickle, you know

00:22:07.626 --> 00:22:14.742
| can make you a hundred
times stronger

00:22:14.766 --> 00:22:17.979
Come on, let's sleep for now

00:22:18.003 --> 00:22:21.462
Hold me gently

00:22:21.907 --> 00:22:26.868
Even if you met a dinosaur

00:22:29.014 --> 00:22:35.697
You are the kind of person that
would just laugh it off

00:22:35.721 --> 00:22:42.403
Winning through flower gardens
and storm ravaged plains

00:22:42.427 --> 00:22:50.044
