changing around us

00:22:50.068 --> 00:22:56.718
Distinguishing both the
sour and the sweet

00:22:56.742 --> 00:23:04.742
Just don't give up, because the genius
always comes at the end

00:23:11.022 --> 00:23:13.616
Oh, dear! Someone must have
dropped their wallet.

00:23:14.393 --> 00:23:16.304
